  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0<br><strong>Fits:</strong> All Melee Weapons, individual eligibility by weapon category</p>\n<p>One per weapon. Changes the weapon's melee reach and throwing range table; damage is unchanged. Long and Very Long Handles make the weapon unconcealable and unusable as Popup Melee cyberware; a Very Long Handle also drops it to ROF 1 and needs BODY 14+ to wield one-handed. Light/Medium weapons: Throwing Handle (no melee reach, thrown on the Shortbow table), Short Handle (default), Long Handle (4m/yds), Very Long Handle (6m/yds, thrown on the Bow table), Chain Handle (10m/yds, can't be thrown). Heavy/Very Heavy weapons: Short Handle (default), Long Handle (4m/yds), Very Long Handle (6m/yds, thrown on the Bow table).</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
